    {
      "id": "claim_3fa547e9d421440eb59bccd317503e3f",
      "statement": "CertificateFlow applies its options into a package-level sharedContext flowContext — deliberately process-global so state recorded during the token phase is visible to later phases in the same command; NewCertificateFlow records offline mode and initializes the OfflineCA when --offline is set.",
