    {
      "id": "claim_de5482af69e548c2836f12374a211a36",
      "statement": "The shared flowContext carries: CertificateRequest (set by step ca sign via WithCertificateRequest) and ConfirmationFingerprint, consumed by TokenGenerator.SignToken to bind the CSR fingerprint into the token's cnf claim; SSHPublicKey for SSH sign requests; DisableCustomSANs, set by AWS/GCP/Azure identity provisioners; and CustomAttributes destined for the token user claim.",
