      "id": "claim_9d91e3c790b64920b9c3436aa1eef051",
      "statement": "GetClient parses the token insecurely to support bootstrap tokens: when the payload has a sha (root fingerprint) and an http(s) audience, the CA URL is taken from the token audience and trust is established by SHA-256 fingerprint via ca.WithRootSHA256, needing no root file; otherwise --ca-url and a root file (or the default root path) are required.",
