      "id": "claim_8203dbfd99a04a039e9ceec5a2ddf86f",
      "statement": "CertificateFlow.GenerateToken and GenerateSSHToken delegate to the offline generator or NewTokenFlow, requiring --ca-url/--root only when no --token was supplied (errs.RequiredUnlessFlag); GenerateIdentityToken produces an OIDC-only identity token via NewIdentityTokenFlow in token_flow.go.",
