      "id": "claim_5c74b7d2f2f34977a3335fc3625d54d4",
      "statement": "SAN merging unifies CLI --san values and the token's sans claim with deduplication via splitSANs, which delegates classification to x509util.SplitSANs; the CSR signature is verified locally with cr.CheckSignature() before submission.",
