      "statement": "Sign adds --not-before/--not-after and template data (--set/--set-file) to the SignRequest, calls client.Sign, and writes the certificate chain (CertChainPEM when present, otherwise ServerPEM+CaPEM) as concatenated PEM with mode 0600 via fileutil.WriteFile; the command serializes the private key to 0600 only after a successful sign.",
